    "detailed_description": "The lights went out again. But this time something is different. Feels like I am being watched.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the Spray to make your way around the pitch-black house, find all the keys and get out before whatever is out there gets to you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenge yourself with 4 increasingly hard difficulties where you need to explore a pitch-black house using only your red &quot;Spray&quot; to be able to see around. In order to find the keys listen to the audio cues and spray around to uncover them and collect them. Gather from 8 up to 30 depending on difficulty and escape by exiting the enclosing.",
